          <p className="max-w-xl mx-auto text-center mt-6 text-[10px] text-slate-400 font-bold uppercase tracking-[0.4em] hidden sm:block opacity-30">
            NEXZI Intelligence • Node v2.5.2 • Gemini Engine Pro
          </p>
